ustry-body engagement. Format performance: (1) Long-form text posts (400-1200 words) with narrative + insight — highest engagement + save rate, (2) Carousel posts (5-10 slides with data + insight) — highest saves + shares + LinkedIn algorithm favours, (3) Video (60-180 seconds) — 3-5x reach vs text alone, especially for demonstrable content (plant tours + product demos + team spotlights), (4) LinkedIn Reels (30-90 seconds) — growing rapidly in 2026, especially for younger executive audience, (5) Long-form articles (800-2000 words) — evergreen SEO + LinkedIn Search + trust-building. In Pune, Pune buyer educated + culturally-Maharashtrian + values authenticity + long-cycle relationship. LinkedIn used for BD + talent + industry-association engagement. Rising founder ecosystem."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD's ghostwriting process work for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"6-step process: (1) Voice-capture — 60-min structured interview capturing your vocabulary + opinions + writing patterns + industry-specific framing, (2) Content brief — you fill 15-min brief on this month's themes + topics + client + market news, (3) Draft — writer creates content from voice-captured material + your brief + industry research, (4) Your review — 24-48hr approval SLA via shared doc or WhatsApp, (5) Publish — ITD schedules + publishes on approved date + time, (6) Engagement — ITD monitors + surfaces DMs + high-value comments for your response. Weekly 15-min brief calls capture fresh material. Result: content that sounds authentically yours — because it IS from your voice + insight."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a realistic content velocity for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For Management Consulting + PE/VC in growth mode: 14-18 posts/month + 2-3 long-form articles + newsletter + 1-2 LinkedIn Live/quarter. Below 6-8 posts/month, LinkedIn algorithm reach decays