    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What does LinkedIn content strategy include for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Full-stack monthly content deliverables: (1) Editorial voice + tone development — capture your voice via structured interviews, (2) Monthly content calendar — themes + topics + formats + timing planned 3-4 weeks ahead, (3) Post writing — 14-18 posts/month + 2-3 long-form articles + newsletter + 1-2 LinkedIn Live/quarter, (4) Long-form articles — 800-2000 words, LinkedIn-native + SEO-optimised, (5) Video + Reels + carousel content — 4-8 pieces/month with design + editing, (6) Newsletter setup + management (if Creator Mode active), (7) Engagement + community management — comments + DMs + strategic reactions, (8) Weekly performance review + monthly strategy refinement. In Pune, ITD's content strategy team specialises in Management Consulting + PE/VC.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is a realistic monthly retainer for LinkedIn content strategy for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">In Pune: Rs 40-80K Starter (basic content calendar + 10-14 posts/month + 1 article + engagement), Rs 80K-1.8L Growth (full-stack content + video + Reels + newsletter + LinkedIn Live + weekly review), Rs 1.8-3.5L Enterprise (heavy production + speaking + PR-adjacent content + multi-format storytelling + dedicated senior writer). For Management Consulting + PE/VC with 14-18 posts/month + 2-3 long-form articles + newsletter + 1-2 LinkedIn Live/quarter target.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What kind of posts perform best for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal on LinkedIn?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Industry frameworks + trend analysis + M&A/deal commentary (public deals) + hiring + team + client-story-with-consent + speaking engagements + whitepaper + industry-body engagement. Format performance: (1) Long-form text posts (400-1200 words) with narrative + insight — highest engagement + save rate, (2) Carousel posts (5-10 slides with data + insight) — highest saves + shares + LinkedIn algorithm favours, (3) Video (60-180 seconds) — 3-5x reach vs text alone, especially for demonstrable content (plant tours + product demos + team spotlights), (4) LinkedIn Reels (30-90 seconds) — growing rapidly in 2026, especially for younger executive audience, (5) Long-form articles (800-2000 words) — evergreen SEO + LinkedIn Search + trust-building. In Pune, Pune buyer educated + culturally-Maharashtrian + values authenticity + long-cycle relationship. LinkedIn used for BD + talent + industry-association engagement. Rising founder ecosystem.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does ITD's ghostwriting process work for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">6-step process: (1) Voice-capture — 60-min structured interview capturing your vocabulary + opinions + writing patterns + industry-specific framing, (2) Content brief — you fill 15-min brief on this month's themes + topics + client + market news, (3) Draft — writer creates content from voice-captured material + your brief + industry research, (4) Your review — 24-48hr approval SLA via shared doc or WhatsApp, (5) Publish — ITD schedules + publishes on approved date + time, (6) Engagement — ITD monitors + surfaces DMs + high-value comments for your response. Weekly 15-min brief calls capture fresh material. Result: content that sounds authentically yours — because it IS from your voice + insight.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is a realistic content velocity for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">For Management Consulting + PE/VC in growth mode: 14-18 posts/month + 2-3 long-form articles + newsletter + 1-2 LinkedIn Live/quarter. Below 6-8 posts/month, LinkedIn algorithm reach decays + reduced brand-recall. Above 30 posts/month, engagement dilutes + audience fatigue. Ideal: consistent + high-quality > sporadic + volume. Weekly cadence of 3-6 posts sustains algorithm reach + audience engagement. In Pune with 30+ lakh LinkedIn members. Dense IT + BPO middle-management + auto-industry supply-chain leadership + SaaS-founder emerging + real-estate + education-industry, top-performing Management Consulting + PE/VC accounts sustain 14-18 posts/month + 2-3 long-form articles + newsletter + 1-2 LinkedIn Live/quarter consistently for 12+ months to see compounding + evergreen effect.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How much engagement + follower growth should we expect from a content-only LinkedIn strategy?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Content-only strategy (no LinkedIn Ads + no outbound Sales Nav) growth: Month 1-3: 300-1,200 new followers/month, 5-15% engagement, 20-100 profile views/day. Month 3-6: 1,000-3,500 new followers/month, engagement compounds, 50-300 profile views/day, first inbound DMs. Month 6-12: 2,000-6,000 new followers/month if content velocity + quality sustained, 200-1,500 profile views/day, consistent inbound. Month 12+: compounding — evergreen content library drives ongoing discovery + inbound for 24+ months. Adding Ads + Sales Nav accelerates growth 2-4x.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Should we prioritise text + carousel + video for LinkedIn in 2026?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Balanced multi-format is optimal in 2026 LinkedIn algorithm. Ideal ratio: 40-50% text (long-form + narrative), 20-25% carousel (data + framework + insight — highest save rate), 15-20% video (30-180 sec — highest reach), 10-15% single image (product/team/event photo + short caption), 5-10% LinkedIn Reels + shorter video. Long-form articles 2-3/month cross-published to newsletter (if Creator Mode active). Multi-format signals content-quality to LinkedIn algorithm + serves different audience preferences. In Pune, Pune buyer educated + culturally-Maharashtrian + values authenticity + long-cycle relationship. LinkedIn used for BD + talent + industry-association engagement. Rising founder ecosystem.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does newsletter + Creator Mode work for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Creator Mode + LinkedIn Newsletter is the highest-ROI content play in 2026 for Management Consulting + PE/VC. Effect: (1) Creator Mode enables newsletter — subscribers get email notification on every new edition (email deliverability + inbox visibility), (2) LinkedIn algorithm heavily amplifies newsletter content, (3) Newsletter subscribers become high-intent audience (10-25x more likely to book meeting vs regular follower), (4) 6-12 month newsletter builds 5K-100K+ subscribers for consistent publishers. In Pune, senior professionals in Management Consulting, Strategy, Private Equity + Venture Capital who run newsletters (like top consulting partners + PE/VC principals + SaaS founders) drive massive inbound. ITD Growth + Enterprise tiers include newsletter setup + management.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we handle LinkedIn Live + long-form video for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">LinkedIn Live is under-utilised opportunity — 30-60 minute live sessions on major themes (market outlook + product launch + industry trend + Q&A) drive massive reach + high-intent audience. ITD workflow: (1) Monthly LinkedIn Live planning — topic + guest + promotion 2 weeks pre, (2) Live production support — teleprompter + coach + technical setup, (3) Live promotion — pre + during + post-event content, (4) Post-event — replay + highlights + quote-cards + long-form article summary. In Pune, LinkedIn Live typically draws 500-5,000+ live viewers for well-promoted senior professionals + drives 30-100 booked meetings/session.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we track LinkedIn content ROI for a Pune consulting firm or PE/VC principal?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Weekly: post reach + engagement + saves + shares + comments + follower growth + newsletter subscribers + profile views + inbound DMs. Monthly: brand-search lift (Google search for your name/firm) + inbound qualified DMs + booked meetings + LinkedIn-attributed pipeline + newsletter engagement. Quarterly: cohort attribution — closed revenue attributable to LinkedIn-first buyers + brand equity signals + hiring + speaking + partnership. Realistic: 2-4 months for meaningful engagement compounding + 6-12 months for major ROI + 12-24 months for evergreen library becoming dominant channel.</div>
